### 1. Afficher la liste des véhicules
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Ajouter un véhicule
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "immatriculation": "TU-2026-105",
  "marque": "Toyota",
  "modele": "Yaris",
  "categorie": "CITADINE",
  "tarifJournalier": 120.00,
  "statut": "DISPONIBLE"
}

###

### 3. Vérifier la liste après l'ajout
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Rechercher le véhicule par ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules/16
Accept: application/json

###
### 5. Modifier le véhicule
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules/20
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "immatriculation": "TU-2026-105",
  "marque": "Toyota",
  "modele": "Yaris",
  "categorie": "CITADINE",
  "tarifJournalier": 150.00,
  "statut": "DISPONIBLE"
}
###
### Vérifier la modification
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules/16
Accept: application/json

### 6. Supprimer le véhicule
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules/8
Accept: application/json

###

GET http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules
Accept: application/json

### 7. Vérifier la liste après la suppression
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules
Accept: application/json

### Vérifier si le véhicule 8 existe encore
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules/20
Accept: application/json

### 6. Supprimer le véhicule
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules/20
Accept: application/json